# A tour of the caelestia port for someone watching a VISIBLE=1 sandbox,
# then the session left to them (the run ends at TIMEOUT). Nothing repeats.
point 960 600; wait 3
open launcher; wait 3
k ki; wait 3
k -k BackSpace -k BackSpace; k ">"; wait 3
close; wait 2
open dashboard; wait 4
click 879 45; wait 3
click 670 45; wait 3
point 960 800; close; wait 2
# Yours from here: hover the top edge for the dashboard, the power button,
# the bar; `morf ipc call launcher` is not reachable from outside, so the
# tour opened it once.
wait 3600
